{
"Items.FlamespiritRing.Desc": "A golden ring engraved with the image of an everlasting flame, the emblem of the inquisitors. It increases the wearer's spell power tremendously, but will also raise the cost of spells.\n\n<i>Inquisitors were known to cast magic using their own lifeforce. The more devout and experienced among them wore this ring, and cared not for the pain they felt while purging the demonic plague.</i> "
"Items.FlamespiritRing.Long": "a gold and black ring with a flame emblem"
"Items.FlamespiritRing.Short": "Flamespirit Ring"
}
